d chances, and no stopping. As you auto-run forward, you\u2019ll need quick reflexes and head-turning awareness to dodge unpredictable traffic, weave through tight lane shifts, and push your limits for the ultimate high score.\n\nKey Features:\nHeart-Pounding VR Perspective: Experience true 1:1 scale speed as massive trucks, sleek cars, and unpredictable vehicles rush right past your face.\n\nSimple Mechanics, Addictive Gameplay: Easy to pick up for anyone, but brutal to master. Just look, steer, dodge, and keep moving!\n\nHigh-Stakes Hazards: One wrong move, one glance away, or one clip of a bumper, and it\u2019s game over.\n\nLeaderboards & High Scores: Beat your personal bests and challenge friends to see who can survive the high-speed chaos the longest.\n\nHow far can you run before the traffic catches up? Put on your headset and test your instincts today!", "short_description": "Feel the adrenaline as you dodge high-speed traffic on foot! Keep running, weave through tight gaps, and survive the ultimate VR end-less racer."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://illustratorgraphics.blogspot.com/p/privacy-policy-this-privacy-policy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Villain Game Studio", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://illustratorgraphics.blogspot.com/p/privacy-policy-this-privacy-policy.html", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "2776542286000603"}, {"id": "1592192974313489"}, {"id": "673385183287495"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCU